{"4917390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Quit Stalin", "steam_appid": 4917390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stalin's on your couch, and one wrong word sends you and your family to the gulag.</strong><br>Every question you ask, every angle you push, is a bet and he's the kind of patient who remembers who bet against him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your psychological method:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Adlerian analysis</strong> to pick apart his hunger for power. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freudian methods</strong> to catch what he won't say on purpose. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jungian framework</strong>  if you're brave enough to ask what he thinks he's protecting the world from. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the moral dilemma: get on his side and buy your family a better life, or fight him and watch them pay for it. Choice is yours.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stalin's on your couch, and one wrong word sends you and your family to the gulag.</strong><br>Every question you ask, every angle you push, is a bet and he's the kind of patient who remembers who bet against him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your psychological method:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Adlerian analysis</strong> to pick apart his hunger for power. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freudian methods</strong> to catch what he won't say on purpose. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jungian framework</strong>  if you're brave enough to ask what he thinks he's protecting the world from. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the moral dilemma: get on his side and buy your family a better life, or fight him and watch them pay for it. Choice is yours.</p>", "short_description": "Stalin's on your couch, and one wrong word sends you and your family to the gulag. Get inside his head before he decides you're the problem. Freud, Adler, Jung - pick your psychological method. A dark comedy about therapy, power, and what it costs to tell a tyrant the truth.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Czech<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917390/114490c753fdd3236df923d557013a0857811b79/header.jpg?t=1784298608", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917390/3658a2a9b57acc01872d29a73f7d621686c1e477/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784298608", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917390/3658a2a9b57acc01872d29a73f7d621686c1e477/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784298608", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> integrated</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i7<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 2080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> integrated</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Jon Aegis"], "publishers": ["Jon Aegis"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories